msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Historique des versions"

msgid "Version history"
msgstr "Historique des versions"

msgid ""
"Each published version keeps its own documentation on the `GitHub Pages "
"archive <https://biface.github.io/ndt/>`_, under ``/vX.Y.Z/``; from "
"1.3.0, the French translation is under ``/fr/vX.Y.Z/``. Read the Docs "
"serves `stable <https://ndict-tools.readthedocs.io/en/stable/>`_ (the "
"last published version) and `latest <https://ndict-"
"tools.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`_ (the development version). Earlier 0.x"
" versions are not documented; the documentation of 0.9.0 is kept until "
"October 2027."
msgstr ""
"Chaque version publiée conserve sa propre documentation dans l’`GitHub "
"Pages archive <https://biface.github.io/ndt/>`_, sous ``/vX.Y.Z/`` ; à "
"partir de la 1.3.0, la traduction française se trouve sous "
"``/fr/vX.Y.Z/``. Read the Docs sert `stable <https://ndict-"
"tools.readthedocs.io/en/stable/>`_ (la dernière version publiée) et "
"`latest <https://ndict-tools.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`_ (la version de "
"développement). Les versions 0.x antérieures ne sont pas documentées ; la"
" documentation de la 0.9.0 est conservée jusqu’en octobre 2027."

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Version"

msgid "Date"
msgstr "Date"

msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Résumé"

msgid "`1.3.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v1.3.0/>`__"
msgstr "`1.3.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v1.3.0/>`__"

msgid "2026-10-09"
msgstr "2026-10-09"

msgid ""
"Python 3.11 minimum, typed package (``py.typed``), strict ``==`` "
"(breaking), Guide and Concepts rewritten, French translation, per-version"
" documentation archive."
msgstr ""
"Python 3.11 minimum, paquet typé (``py.typed``), ``==`` strict (rupture "
"de compatibilité), Guide et Concepts réécrits, traduction française, "
"archive de la documentation par version."

msgid "`1.2.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v1.2.0/>`__"
msgstr "`1.2.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v1.2.0/>`__"

msgid "2026-05-06"
msgstr "2026-05-06"

msgid "Cleanup, documentation overhaul, removal of ``DictPaths``."
msgstr "Nettoyage, refonte de la documentation, suppression de ``DictPaths``."

msgid "`1.1.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v1.1.0/>`__"
msgstr "`1.1.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v1.1.0/>`__"

msgid "2026-04-05"
msgstr "2026-04-05"

msgid ""
"Serialisation (JSON + pickle), ``from_dict`` classmethod, Python 3.13 "
"support, Python 3.9 dropped."
msgstr ""
"Sérialisation (JSON + pickle), méthode de classe ``from_dict``, prise en "
"charge de Python 3.13, abandon de Python 3.9."

msgid "`1.0.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v1.0.0/>`__"
msgstr "`1.0.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v1.0.0/>`__"

msgid "2026-01-31"
msgstr "2026-01-31"

msgid "First stable release. Public API, exception hierarchy, PyPI publication."
msgstr ""
"Première version stable. API publique, hiérarchie d’exceptions, "
"publication sur PyPI."

msgid "`0.9.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v0.9.0/>`__"
msgstr "`0.9.0 <https://biface.github.io/ndt/v0.9.0/>`__"

msgid "2025-11-04"
msgstr "2025-11-04"

msgid ""
"``default_setup`` generalised, Python versions earlier than 3.9 dropped. "
"Gathers the earlier 0.x work. Documentation kept until October 2027."
msgstr ""
"``default_setup`` généralisé, abandon des versions de Python antérieures "
"à 3.9. Rassemble le travail des versions 0.x précédentes. Documentation "
"conservée jusqu’en octobre 2027."

msgid "Full history"
msgstr "Historique complet"

msgid "The complete change log is maintained in :doc:`history`."
msgstr "Le journal complet des modifications est tenu dans :doc:`history`."

msgid "Active deprecations are listed in :doc:`deprecations`."
msgstr "Les dépréciations en cours sont énumérées dans :doc:`deprecations`."

